  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v5.0.0 — major release with breaking changes. Highlights: RSA-OAEP encryption, selectable PBKDF2 PRF, X.509 CRL revocation checking, and net10.0 added to the target frameworks. Breaking: Argon2 int parameters replaced by enums, factory-method renames (Create*Service), EncodingExtensions now defaults to UTF-8 on every TFM, removed dead synchronous stream extensions, and sealed service/factory classes. See RELEASENOTES.md for the full migration guide.",
